n.ca-standard {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 28px 20px;\n  background: rgba(10,25,42,0.6);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.12);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n.ca-standard-icon { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; }\n\n.ca-standard h4 {\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #fff;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n.ca-standard p {\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: #7a8fa6;\n}\n\n\/* ── MISSION STRIP ── *\/\n.ca-mission {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(74,143,212,0.07), rgba(10,25,42,0.7));\n  border: 1px solid rgba(74,143,212,0.2);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 40px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 32px;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n}\n\n.ca-mission-icon { font-size: 2.8rem; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n.ca-mission h3 {\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #fff;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.ca-mission h3 span { color: #4a8fd4; }\n\n.ca-mission p {\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: #7a8fa6;\n}\n\n.ca-mission p strong { color: #4a8fd4; font-weight: 500; }\n\n\/* ── TAGLINE ── *\/\n.ca-tagline {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;\n  font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #fff;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n}\n\n.ca-tagline span { color: #C9A84C; }\n\n@media (max-width: 700px) {\n  .ca-source { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }\n  .ca-hero-content { padding: 32px 24px; }\n  .ca-mission { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }\n  .ca-philosophy { padding: 32px 24px; }\n}\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"ca-wrap\">\n\n  <!-- HERO -->\n  <div class=\"ca-hero\">\n    <div class=\"ca-hero-bg\"><\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-hero-overlay\"><\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-hero-wave\"><\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-hero-content\">\n      <div class=\"ca-badge\">✦ Healthy Kindness · Performance Nutrition<\/div>\n      <h1>Protein <span>&amp; Blends<\/span><\/h1>\n      <p class=\"ca-hero-sub\">Clean Protein · Plant-Based · Performance Blends<\/p>\n      <p>Protein is not just for athletes. It is the structural material your body uses to build and repair virtually everything — muscle, tissue, enzymes, hormones, and immune cells. This collection brings together clean protein sources and functional blends for anyone who wants to fuel their body with intention, not just convenience.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- SOURCE STORY -->\n  <div class=\"ca-source\">\n    <div class=\"ca-source-text\">\n      <div class=\"ca-label\">The Foundation<\/div>\n      <h2>More Than <span>Muscle<\/span><\/h2>\n      <p>The fitness industry has spent decades narrowing protein down to a gym supplement. The reality is broader. <strong>Protein is the most abundant molecule in the human body<\/strong> after water — and adequate daily intake affects everything from metabolism and immune function to mood, skin health, and cognitive performance.<\/p>\n      <p>Most people are not eating enough. And many who do supplement are doing so with products loaded with <strong>artificial sweeteners, fillers, and synthetic flavoring<\/strong> that undermine the health goals they are trying to support.<\/p>\n      <p>This collection is built around clean sources, honest labels, and the principle from the <strong>Fifth Protocol Body curriculum<\/strong> that your nutrition should work with your biology — not against it.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-source-stats\">\n      <div class=\"ca-stat\">\n        <span class=\"ca-stat-icon\">💪<\/span>\n        <h4>Build &amp; Repair<\/h4>\n        <p>Every tissue in the body depends on dietary protein for growth, repair, and maintenance<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ca-stat\">\n        <span class=\"ca-stat-icon\">🧬<\/span>\n        <h4>Complete Amino Profile<\/h4>\n        <p>Quality proteins deliver all essential amino acids the body cannot produce on its own<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ca-stat\">\n        <span class=\"ca-stat-icon\">⚡<\/span>\n        <h4>Sustained Energy<\/h4>\n        <p>Protein supports stable blood sugar and sustained energy throughout the day<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"ca-stat\">\n        <span class=\"ca-stat-icon\">🛡️<\/span>\n        <h4>Immune Function<\/h4>\n        <p>Antibodies, immune cells, and protective enzymes are all built from dietary protein<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-divider\"><\/div>\n\n  <!-- PHILOSOPHY -->\n  <div class=\"ca-philosophy\">\n    <blockquote>\n      \"Feed your body what it actually needs —<br>\n      not what the label <span>makes you think you need.<\/span>\"\n    <\/blockquote>\n    <cite>Protein &amp; Blends · Healthy Kindness · Fifth Protocol<\/cite>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-divider\"><\/div>\n\n  <!-- CATEGORIES -->\n  <div class=\"ca-categories\">\n    <div class=\"ca-label\">What's Inside<\/div>\n    <h2>The <span>Collection<\/span><\/h2>\n    <div class=\"ca-cat-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"ca-cat-card whey\">\n        <span class=\"ca-cat-icon\">🥛<\/span>\n        <h3>Whey &amp; Animal-Based<\/h3>\n        <p>High-quality animal-derived proteins with complete amino acid profiles — fast-absorbing options for recovery and daily protein needs, sourced and processed without unnecessary additives.<\/p>\n        <ul class=\"ca-cat-items\">\n          <li>Whey protein isolate &amp; concentrate<\/li>\n          <li>Casein for slow-release overnight support<\/li>\n          <li>Collagen peptides for joints &amp; skin<\/li>\n          <li>Grass-fed sourcing where available<\/li>\n          <li>Expanding regularly<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"ca-cat-card plant\">\n        <span class=\"ca-cat-icon\">🌱<\/span>\n        <h3>Plant-Based Protein<\/h3>\n        <p>Clean plant protein options for those who prefer or require non-animal sources — formulated to deliver complete amino coverage and real digestibility without the chalky texture or artificial flavoring common in the category.<\/p>\n        <ul class=\"ca-cat-items\">\n          <li>Pea protein isolate<\/li>\n          <li>Brown rice protein<\/li>\n          <li>Hemp seed protein<\/li>\n          <li>Multi-source plant blends<\/li>\n          <li>New sources added regularly<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"ca-cat-card blends\">\n        <span class=\"ca-cat-icon\">⚗️<\/span>\n        <h3>Functional Protein Blends<\/h3>\n        <p>Protein combined with purpose — functional blends that pair clean protein with targeted support ingredients for recovery, energy, gut health, and whole-body daily performance.<\/p>\n        <ul class=\"ca-cat-items\">\n          <li>Protein + digestive enzyme blends<\/li>\n          <li>Recovery formulas with added BCAAs<\/li>\n          <li>Meal replacement blends<\/li>\n          <li>Protein + adaptogen combinations<\/li>\n          <li>New blends added regularly<\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-divider\"><\/div>\n\n  <!-- STANDARDS -->\n  <div class=\"ca-label\" style=\"font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;color:#C9A84C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n    <span style=\"width:24px;height:1px;background:#C9A84C;display:inline-block;\"><\/span>\n    Our Standards\n  <\/div>\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2.2rem);font-weight:600;color:#fff;margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    What We Will <span style=\"color:#C9A84C;\">Never Compromise<\/span>\n  <\/h2>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-standards\">\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">🚫<\/span>\n      <h4>No Artificial Sweeteners<\/h4>\n      <p>Sucralose, aspartame, and acesulfame-K are not in our products. We use clean, natural sweetening where needed.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">🧬<\/span>\n      <h4>No Proprietary Blends<\/h4>\n      <p>We do not hide ingredient amounts behind blend labels. What's in the product is on the label — clearly and honestly.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">🌱<\/span>\n      <h4>Clean Sourcing<\/h4>\n      <p>Animal proteins sourced from quality suppliers. Plant proteins free from pesticide-heavy growing practices where possible.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">🔬<\/span>\n      <h4>Purposeful Formulation<\/h4>\n      <p>Every ingredient in every blend is there for a reason. We do not pad labels with cheap fillers or trendy add-ons.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"ca-standard\">\n      <span class=\"ca-standard-icon\">📖<\/span>\n      <h4>Education First<\/h4>\n      <p>Every product connects to the Fifth Protocol Body curriculum — so you know what you're fueling your body with and why it matters.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"ca-divider\"><\/div>\n\n  <!-- MISSION -->\n  <div class=\"ca-mission\">\n    <div class=\"ca-mission-icon\">🤝<\/div>\n    <div>\n      <h3>Every Purchase <span>Funds the Mission<\/span><\/h3>\n      <p>The Protein &amp; Blends collection is powered by <strong>Healthy Kindness<\/strong> — and every product you buy supports the <strong>Fifth Protocol mission<\/strong> of educating communities with truth, empowering individuals with real tools for their health, and giving nonprofits a better way to fundraise than selling junk food.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- TAGLINE -->\n  <div class=\"ca-tagline\">\n    <span>Be True.<\/span> Live Well.\n  <\/div>\n\n<\/div>","color_scheme":"","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}},"banner":{"type":"main-collection-banner","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_collection_descripti